        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage B60COL, Square Single Cylinder Collins Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Collins Deadbolt is Schlage's modern, square door lock. It is a single cylinder deadbolt, meaning a key is used to unlock and lock from the outside and traditional thumb turn works the front door lock from the inside. The Collins Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt will fit standard pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door frame strike reinforced with 3\" screws for extra security.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5, 2001, Grade 1 auxiliary lock.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<li>Has an anti-pick shield around the cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass cylinder and trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Deadbolt with Collins Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8” or 2-3/4”</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1-1/8” x 2-3/4”, 1/4” radius corner</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: 5-pin, C Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
