                "description": "The Collins Deadbolt is Schlage's modern, square door lock. It is a single cylinder deadbolt, meaning a key is used to unlock and lock from the outside and traditional thumb turn works the front door lock from the inside. The Collins Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt will fit standard pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
